{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3f01b5a16c0fa7c2","name":"Control Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-3f01b5a16c0fa7c2","title":"Control Talent Tree","revision":24989,"timestamp":"2024-11-10T16:49:15Z","sha256":"bd1b0f1b019b2b20df753b9bc970ad5fbfc9e32a9ecfbb21dec481b74c582e88","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24989","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Control%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3f01b5a16c0fa7c2","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You have learned how to regulate your own body systems, control your emotions, and channel ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},".\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Damage Reduction 10"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," to gain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"}," 10 for 1 minute.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Equilibrium"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to remove all debilitating ",{"tag":"a","children":["Conditions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Conditions","referenceId":"reference:97d4be8960698f97"}," affecting you and return to a normal state.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Jedi Counseling"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Counseling"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Counseling"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Q:"]}," Does the ",{"tag":"b","children":["Equilibrium"]}," Talent move you to the top of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},", or does it remove ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent Conditions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent_Conditions"}," (such as from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Poison"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Poison"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disease"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disease"},", or serious injury)?\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["A:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Equilibrium"]}," does both of these, removing all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent Conditions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent_Conditions"}," ",{"tag":"i","children":["and"]}," moving you to the top of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},".\n"]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Force Focus"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},", you may make a DC 15 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check. If the check succeeds, you regain one spent ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," of your choice.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Force Recovery"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Equilibrium"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you use your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Second Wind"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Second_Wind"},", you regain a number of additional ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," equal to 1d6 per ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," you possess (maximum 10d6).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Additional Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Beast Trick"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mind Trick"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mind_Trick","referenceId":"reference:5c0f83fb6ec25f33"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can use the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Mind Trick"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mind_Trick","referenceId":"reference:5c0f83fb6ec25f33"}]}," Force Power on creatures with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"}," score of 2 and lower. However, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"}," score of 2 or less still cannot perform any complex actions, or understand complex commands it wouldn't otherwise be able to understand. An affected ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," might understand \"Attack those sith troopers!\" but it would not comprehend, \"Break into the command center, and disable the communications array.\"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Channel Energy"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Negate Energy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Negate_Energy","referenceId":"reference:038d9df24b6fe0a9"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you use the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Negate Energy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Negate_Energy","referenceId":"reference:038d9df24b6fe0a9"}]}," Force Power to successfully negate the damage from an Energy weapon attack, you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," to immediately activate any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," currently in your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power Suite"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power_Suite"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Force Exertion"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Training"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Training","referenceId":"reference:24f2c1df8e62fd15"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you select this Talent, choose one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," that you have in your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power Suite"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power_Suite"},". As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},", you can remove any one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," from your active ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power Suite"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power_Suite"}," to add an extra use of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," designated by this Talent. Doing so moves you -1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent"}," step along the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},". This ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent Condition"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent_Condition"}," is removed by resting for 1 minute. You can select this Talent multiple times. Each time you do so, you choose a different ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," to be gained by using this Talent.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Force Harmony"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, you can activate one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Talent"}," that requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to use without spending a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Force Suppression"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebuke"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebuke","referenceId":"reference:b729f880ae397e8e"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you use the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Rebuke"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebuke","referenceId":"reference:b729f880ae397e8e"}]}," Force Power to attempt to negate or redirect a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," used against you, but fail to overcome your opponent's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check result, you instead lessen the effect of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," by one step. For example, if an opponent attempted to use the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Slow"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Slow","referenceId":"reference:4b2bebbf33aeb7ae"}]}," Force Power on you and rolled a 21, if you fail to ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Rebuke"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebuke","referenceId":"reference:b729f880ae397e8e"}]}," the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"},", you only suffer the DC 15 effect, instead of the DC 20 effect. This Talent only affects ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Powers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Powers","referenceId":"reference:85acec94cd1ca5f3"}," that have variable effects based on your opponent's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," checks, and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Powers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Powers","referenceId":"reference:85acec94cd1ca5f3"}," with static DCs without variable effects (such as ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Lightning"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Lightning","referenceId":"reference:a654f003ddc04a24"}]},") are unaffected.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Indomitable Will"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," to become immune to all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mind-Affecting"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mind-Affecting"}," effects for 1 minute.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["The Will to Resist"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per turn, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," to being targeted by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," or other ability that targets your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},", you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check and replace your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," with the result of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check. After you make this check, until the end of your next turn, you take a -5 penalty on all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," checks.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Telekinetic Stability"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever an attack or effect would normally move you against your will (such as being targeted by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bantha Rush"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bantha_Rush","referenceId":"reference:538eb665ec0bd30c"},", or being moved by the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Thrust"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Thrust","referenceId":"reference:71dad1bff9398936"}]}," Force Power), you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to negate that movement.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
